      "data": {
        "text": "**Developing the Python Script**\n\nI've just finished the `timestamped_transcript.py` script. It uses AssemblyAI for transcription, and I've ensured it generates word-level timestamps, as required. I've also included a basic example to showcase how to use the function.\n\n\n**Confirming Provider Implementation**\n\nI've verified the AssemblyAI provider integration in `timestamped_transcript.py`. The code clearly identifies AssemblyAI through imports, API key setting, and object instantiation. I've confirmed that the code configures the transcription process and handles potential error states, thus fulfilling all specified requirements for the provider.\n\n\n",
